{"PageNumber":382,"Verses":[{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":56,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"۞فَمَا كَانَ جَوَابَ قَوۡمِهِۦٓ إِلَّآ أَن قَالُوٓاْ أَخۡرِجُوٓاْ ءَالَ لُوطٖ مِّن قَرۡيَتِكُمۡۖ إِنَّهُمۡ أُنَاسٞ يَتَطَهَّرُونَ","TajweedText":"۞ فَمَا كَانَ جَوَابَ قَوْمِه<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ِۦٓ</tajweed> إِلّ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>َآ</tajweed> أَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>َال<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> أَخْرِج<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ُوٓ</tajweed><tajweed class=slnt>اْ</tajweed> ءَالَ لُو<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>طٍ م</tajweed>ِّ<tajweed class=ikhafa>ن ق</tajweed>َرْيَتِكُمْ‌ۖ إِ<tajweed class=ghunnah>نّ</tajweed>َهُمْ أُنَا<tajweed class=idgham_ghunnah>سٌ ي</tajweed>َتَطَهَّر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ُو</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٦</span>","End":"٥٦","PageNumber":382,"JuzNumber":20,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":153,"HizbNumber":39,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":57,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"فَأَنجَيۡنَٰهُ وَأَهۡلَهُۥٓ إِلَّا ٱمۡرَأَتَهُۥ قَدَّرۡنَٰهَا مِنَ ٱلۡغَٰبِرِينَ","TajweedText":"فَأَ<tajweed class=ikhafa>نج</tajweed>َيْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هُ وَأَهْلَهُ<tajweed class=madda_obligatory>ۥٓ</tajweed> إِلَّا <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>مْرَأَتَهُ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ۥ</tajweed> قَدَّرْنَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>هَا مِنَ <tajweed class=ham_wasl>ٱ</tajweed>لْغَ<tajweed class=madda_normal>ـٰ</tajweed>بِر<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٥٧</span>","End":"٥٧","PageNumber":382,"JuzNumber":20,"ManzilNumber":5,"RukuNumber":330,"MaqraNumber":153,"HizbNumber":39,"HizbDecimal":0.0,"HasSajda":false},{"SurahNumber":27,"SurahIndex":"027","VerseNumber":58,"ShowSurahName":false,"ShowBismillah":false,"Text":"وَأَمۡطَرۡنَا عَلَيۡهِم مَّطَرٗاۖ فَسَآءَ مَطَرُ ٱلۡمُنذَرِ